=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803280/extras/b90a3ce366a524723700846a627a0d6c.poster.avif?t=1751874140\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803280/extras/b90a3ce366a524723700846a627a0d6c.webm?t=1751874140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803280/extras/b90a3ce366a524723700846a627a0d6c.mp4?t=1751874140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The current situation</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrupted enemies are gradually expanding their territory, threatening neighboring regions. In this chaos, the Black Dawn is leading the Corruption from behind the scenes, but their true purpose is shrouded in mystery. Lore says that only by destroying the [Guernians] will the lost order return, but the deeper you explore, the more you question the truth of even this belief. The closer you get to the citadel, the more you'll come face-to-face with the greater secret that brought the world to its knees.</p>","developers":["TeamSuneat"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2803280/2f4992193b3cacfdd9dd3fdf65eaf58a5d6005aa/header.jpg?t=1751874140","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 PM Studios, Inc. Dragon is Dead is a registered trademark of PM Studios, Inc. Created and developed by TeamSuneat, a subsidiary of PM Studios, Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2803280/647453762/b83dd664e78a92a689c44ef89b76fd4b9f52fda0/1750820118/dash_av1.mp